ening up blocks 200 times </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended for:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who enjoy grinding game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to collect many items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who enjoy creating builds in hack-and-slash games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who seek a relaxing game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Policy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be streamed or have videos posted without prior permission, whether you are an individual or a company.<br>There are no restrictions on monetization or which parts of the game you can showcase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Save Transfer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap the &quot;<strong>Get Demo Data</strong>&quot; button at the top right of the title screen to continue from the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916770/extras/c29e8a3e47fb12ce5dfd6b9272204818.avif?t=1782899579\" width=500 height=170 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining game meets <strong>hack-and-slash</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining for minerals without enemies or time limits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge drills with puzzle-like smithing system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with special effects that create synergies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional stages for strong miners. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916770/extras/e7ac5e4e989303ae439d219a208bd012.avif?t=1782899579\" width=400 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr